<p data-start=3D"850" data-end=3D"875">Very simplified pipeline:</p>
<ol data-start=3D"877" data-end=3D"1157">
<li data-start=3D"877" data-end=3D"891">
<p data-start=3D"880" data-end=3D"891">Execute SQL</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"892" data-end=3D"1157">
<p data-start=3D"895" data-end=3D"908">For each row:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"912" data-end=3D"1157">
<li data-start=3D"912" data-end=3D"933">
<p data-start=3D"914" data-end=3D"933">Hydrate state array</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"937" data-end=3D"975">
<p data-start=3D"939" data-end=3D"975">Resolve entity key (EntityName + id)=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"979" data-end=3D"1011">
<p data-start=3D"981" data-end=3D"1011">Check L1 (Persistence Context)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1015" data-end=3D"1040">
<p data-start=3D"1017" data-end=3D"1040">If not in L1 =E2=86=92 check L2</p=
>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1044" data-end=3D"1072">
<p data-start=3D"1046" data-end=3D"1072">Decide what to instantiate</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1076" data-end=3D"1090">
<p data-start=3D"1078" data-end=3D"1090">Inject state</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1094" data-end=3D"1127">
<p data-start=3D"1096" data-end=3D"1127">Register in Persistence Context</p=
>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1131" data-end=3D"1157">
<p data-start=3D"1133" data-end=3D"1157">Trigger post-load events</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start=3D"1159" data-end=3D"1231">Important:<br>
Hydration happens before entity materialization is finalized.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1233" data-end=3D"1236">
<h1 data-start=3D"1238" data-end=3D"1262">3=EF=B8=8F=E2=83=A3 Your Core Que=
stion</h1>
<blockquote data-start=3D"1264" data-end=3D"1342">
<p data-start=3D"1266" data-end=3D"1342">Why doesn=E2=80=99t Hibernate use =
ResultSet data directly instead of using L2 cache?</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start=3D"1344" data-end=3D"1407">Because <strong data-start=3D"1352=
" data-end=3D"1387">L2 cache is authoritative state</strong>, not the Resul=
tSet.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1409" data-end=3D"1448">This is subtle but extremely impor=
tant.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1450" data-end=3D"1453">
<h1 data-start=3D"1455" data-end=3D"1495">4=EF=B8=8F=E2=83=A3 Why ResultSet=
 Is NOT Trusted State</h1>
<p data-start=3D"1497" data-end=3D"1511">The ResultSet:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1513" data-end=3D"1727">
<li data-start=3D"1513" data-end=3D"1552">
<p data-start=3D"1515" data-end=3D"1552">Is tied to one specific SQL execut=
ion</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1553" data-end=3D"1582">
<p data-start=3D"1555" data-end=3D"1582">May contain partial columns</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1583" data-end=3D"1625">
<p data-start=3D"1585" data-end=3D"1625">May contain duplicated rows (join =
fetch)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1626" data-end=3D"1651">
<p data-start=3D"1628" data-end=3D"1651">May contain projections</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1652" data-end=3D"1693">
<p data-start=3D"1654" data-end=3D"1693">May not respect entity mutability =
rules</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1694" data-end=3D"1727">
<p data-start=3D"1696" data-end=3D"1727">May not include lazy properties</p=
>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1729" data-end=3D"1742">But L2 cache:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1744" data-end=3D"1898">
<li data-start=3D"1744" data-end=3D"1797">
<p data-start=3D"1746" data-end=3D"1797">Stores a canonical, normalized sta=
te representation</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1798" data-end=3D"1820">
<p data-start=3D"1800" data-end=3D"1820">Knows version column</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1821" data-end=3D"1844">
<p data-start=3D"1823" data-end=3D"1844">Knows mutability plan</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1845" data-end=3D"1871">
<p data-start=3D"1847" data-end=3D"1871">Knows natural id mapping</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1872" data-end=3D"1898">
<p data-start=3D"1874" data-end=3D"1898">Is structured per-entity</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1900" data-end=3D"1922">Hibernate must ensure:</p>
<blockquote data-start=3D"1924" data-end=3D"1991">
<p data-start=3D"1926" data-end=3D"1991">There is exactly one managed insta=
nce per entity key per Session.</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start=3D"1993" data-end=3D"2081">This invariant cannot be maintaine=
d if it blindly instantiates from every ResultSet row.</p>
