<p data-start=3D"4233" data-end=3D"4255">Once SQL returns rows:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4257" data-end=3D"4384">
<li data-start=3D"4257" data-end=3D"4289">
<p data-start=3D"4259" data-end=3D"4289">The JDBC driver streams values</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4290" data-end=3D"4339">
<p data-start=3D"4292" data-end=3D"4339">Hibernate must read them to move c=
ursor forward</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4340" data-end=3D"4384">
<p data-start=3D"4342" data-end=3D"4384">At minimum, it must read identifie=
r column</p>
