<h1 data-start=3D"4475" data-end=3D"4518">9=EF=B8=8F=E2=83=A3 Practical Arc=
hitecture Recommendation</h1>
<p data-start=3D"4520" data-end=3D"4546">For your described system:</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"4548" data-end=3D"4571">If single-node app:</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4573" data-end=3D"4635">
<li data-start=3D"4573" data-end=3D"4585">
<p data-start=3D"4575" data-end=3D"4585">READ_WRITE</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4586" data-end=3D"4596">
<p data-start=3D"4588" data-end=3D"4596">@Version</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4597" data-end=3D"4618">
<p data-start=3D"4599" data-end=3D"4618">Ehcache or Caffeine</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4619" data-end=3D"4635">
<p data-start=3D"4621" data-end=3D"4635">No query cache</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4637" data-end=3D"4640">
<h3 data-start=3D"4642" data-end=3D"4664">If multi-node app:</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4666" data-end=3D"4773">
<li data-start=3D"4666" data-end=3D"4706">
<p data-start=3D"4668" data-end=3D"4706">Distributed cache (Infinispan clus=
ter)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4707" data-end=3D"4719">
<p data-start=3D"4709" data-end=3D"4719">READ_WRITE</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4720" data-end=3D"4730">
<p data-start=3D"4722" data-end=3D"4730">@Version</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4731" data-end=3D"4773">
<p data-start=3D"4733" data-end=3D"4773">No query cache unless read-mostly =
entity</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4775" data-end=3D"4778">
<h1 data-start=3D"4780" data-end=3D"4817">=F0=9F=94=9F When You Should NOT =
Use L2 Cache</h1>
<p data-start=3D"4819" data-end=3D"4822">If:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4824" data-end=3D"4970">
<li data-start=3D"4824" data-end=3D"4849">
<p data-start=3D"4826" data-end=3D"4849">Data changes frequently</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4850" data-end=3D"4883">
<p data-start=3D"4852" data-end=3D"4883">Reads are mostly unique queries</p=
>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4884" data-end=3D"4912">
<p data-start=3D"4886" data-end=3D"4912">DB is already well-indexed</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4913" data-end=3D"4935">
<p data-start=3D"4915" data-end=3D"4935">Entity size is large</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4936" data-end=3D"4970">
<p data-start=3D"4938" data-end=3D"4970">Cache invalidations are constant</=
p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"4972" data-end=3D"5004">Then L2 may hurt more than help.</=
p>
