<hr data-start=3D"2248" data-end=3D"2251">
<h1 data-start=3D"2253" data-end=3D"2286">3=EF=B8=8F=E2=83=A3 Why It's Call=
ed =E2=80=9CSoft=E2=80=9D Lock</h1>
<p data-start=3D"2288" data-end=3D"2296">Because:</p>
