<li data-start=3D"2298" data-end=3D"2320">
<p data-start=3D"2300" data-end=3D"2320">It is NOT a JVM lock</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2321" data-end=3D"2348">
<p data-start=3D"2323" data-end=3D"2348">It does NOT block threads</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2349" data-end=3D"2378">
<p data-start=3D"2351" data-end=3D"2378">It is a marker in the cache</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2379" data-end=3D"2412">
<p data-start=3D"2381" data-end=3D"2412">Other threads are not suspended</p=
>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2413" data-end=3D"2439">
<p data-start=3D"2415" data-end=3D"2439">They simply bypass cache</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2441" data-end=3D"2485">So it prevents stale reads without=
 blocking.</p>
