</ul>
<p data-start=3D"4820" data-end=3D"4873">Sometimes DB buffer cache already =
solves the problem.</p>
<p data-start=3D"4875" data-end=3D"4925">In that case, L2 adds complexity b=
ut no real gain.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"4927" data-end=3D"4930">
<h2 data-start=3D"4932" data-end=3D"4967">5=EF=B8=8F=E2=83=A3 Common Benchm=
arking Mistakes</h2>
<p data-start=3D"4969" data-end=3D"5144">=E2=9D=8C Testing single user sequ=
ential requests<br data-start=3D"5010" data-end=3D"5013">
