</li>
<li data-start=3D"5414" data-end=3D"5429">
<p data-start=3D"5416" data-end=3D"5429">Lookup tables</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5430" data-end=3D"5462">
<p data-start=3D"5432" data-end=3D"5462">Country/currency/config tables</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5464" data-end=3D"5467">
<h1 data-start=3D"5469" data-end=3D"5493">Final Practical Advice</h1>
<p data-start=3D"5495" data-end=3D"5513">If you're running:</p>
