ed the entity.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1920" data-end=3D"1960">They are completely independent sy=
stems.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1962" data-end=3D"1965">
<h1 data-start=3D"1967" data-end=3D"2000">4=EF=B8=8F=E2=83=A3 When Using Bo=
