</li>
<li data-start=3D"3574" data-end=3D"3617">
<p data-start=3D"3576" data-end=3D"3617">Immutable data =E2=86=92 READ_ONLY=
 cache strategy</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"3619" data-end=3D"3662">This frees DB and avoids unnecessa=
ry joins.</p>
