<hr data-start=3D"2071" data-end=3D"2074">
<h1 data-start=3D"2076" data-end=3D"2121"><strong data-start=3D"2078" data-=
end=3D"2121">Key Optimization Principles Illustrated</strong></h1>
<ol data-start=3D"2123" data-end=3D"3449">
<li data-start=3D"2123" data-end=3D"2264">
<p data-start=3D"2126" data-end=3D"2146"><strong data-start=3D"2126" data-e=
nd=3D"2144">DTO Projection</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2150" data-end=3D"2264">
<li data-start=3D"2150" data-end=3D"2230">
<p data-start=3D"2152" data-end=3D"2230">Avoids full entity hydration =E2=
=86=92 skips L2 lookup entirely for dynamic queries.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2234" data-end=3D"2264">
<p data-start=3D"2236" data-end=3D"2264">Reduces memory and CPU load.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2266" data-end=3D"2455">
<p data-start=3D"2269" data-end=3D"2305"><strong data-start=3D"2269" data-e=
nd=3D"2303">Fetch Only Needed Associations</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2309" data-end=3D"2455">
<li data-start=3D"2309" data-end=3D"2391">
<p data-start=3D"2311" data-end=3D"2391">Use <code data-start=3D"2315" data=
-end=3D"2327">JOIN FETCH</code> or <code data-start=3D"2331" data-end=3D"23=
45">@EntityGraph</code> <strong data-start=3D"2346" data-end=3D"2388">only =
if you actually need associations</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2395" data-end=3D"2455">
<p data-start=3D"2397" data-end=3D"2455">Batch collections with <code data-=
start=3D"2420" data-end=3D"2432">@BatchSize</code> to reduce N+1 problem.</=
p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2457" data-end=3D"2666">
<p data-start=3D"2460" data-end=3D"2492"><strong data-start=3D"2460" data-e=
nd=3D"2490">Read-Only Hint + Streaming</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2496" data-end=3D"2666">
<li data-start=3D"2496" data-end=3D"2579">
<p data-start=3D"2498" data-end=3D"2579">For large datasets, streaming prev=
ents loading the entire result set in memory.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2583" data-end=3D"2666">
<p data-start=3D"2585" data-end=3D"2666"><code data-start=3D"2585" data-end=
=3D"2632">query.setHint("org.hibernate.readOnly", true)</code> disables dir=
ty checking for DTOs.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2668" data-end=3D"2811">
<p data-start=3D"2671" data-end=3D"2687"><strong data-start=3D"2671" data-e=
nd=3D"2685">Pagination</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2691" data-end=3D"2811">
<li data-start=3D"2691" data-end=3D"2753">
<p data-start=3D"2693" data-end=3D"2753">Always fetch in reasonable chunks =
to reduce memory spikes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2757" data-end=3D"2811">
<p data-start=3D"2759" data-end=3D"2811">Spring Data <code data-start=3D"27=
71" data-end=3D"2781">Pageable</code> or native SQL <code data-start=3D"279=
6" data-end=3D"2810">LIMIT/OFFSET</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2813" data-end=3D"2922">
<p data-start=3D"2816" data-end=3D"2857"><strong data-start=3D"2816" data-e=
nd=3D"2855">Avoid Query Cache for Dynamic Specs</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2861" data-end=3D"2922">
<li data-start=3D"2861" data-end=3D"2922">
<p data-start=3D"2863" data-end=3D"2922">Invalidations are frequent =E2=86=
=92 low hit ratio =E2=86=92 adds overhead.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2924" data-end=3D"3140">
<p data-start=3D"2927" data-end=3D"2963"><strong data-start=3D"2927" data-e=
nd=3D"2961">Cache Immutable Reference Data</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2967" data-end=3D"3140">
<li data-start=3D"2967" data-end=3D"3057">
<p data-start=3D"2969" data-end=3D"3057">Spring <code data-start=3D"2976" d=
ata-end=3D"2988">@Cacheable</code> on DTOs, small lookup tables (country li=
st, status codes, config).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3061" data-end=3D"3140">
<p data-start=3D"3063" data-end=3D"3140">Hibernate L2 cache only for identi=
ty lookups of frequently accessed entities.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3142" data-end=3D"3322">
<p data-start=3D"3145" data-end=3D"3171"><strong data-start=3D"3145" data-e=
nd=3D"3169">Leverage DB Features</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"3175" data-end=3D"3322">
<li data-start=3D"3175" data-end=3D"3228">
<p data-start=3D"3177" data-end=3D"3228">Covering indexes for frequently fi=
ltered columns.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3232" data-end=3D"3274">
<p data-start=3D"3234" data-end=3D"3274">Partial indexes for common predica=
tes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3278" data-end=3D"3322">
<p data-start=3D"3280" data-end=3D"3322">Materialized views for heavy aggre=
gations.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3324" data-end=3D"3449">
<p data-start=3D"3327" data-end=3D"3369"><strong data-start=3D"3327" data-e=
nd=3D"3367">Reuse Criteria/Specification Objects</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"3373" data-end=3D"3449">
<li data-start=3D"3373" data-end=3D"3449">
<p data-start=3D"3375" data-end=3D"3449">Hibernate query plan cache is reus=
ed =E2=86=92 reduces query compilation overhead.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"3451" data-end=3D"3454">
<h1 data-start=3D"3456" data-end=3D"3473"><strong data-start=3D"3458" data-=
end=3D"3473">Bottom Line</strong></h1>
<p data-start=3D"3475" data-end=3D"3507">For read-heavy, dynamic queries:</=
p>
<ul data-start=3D"3509" data-end=3D"3717">
<li data-start=3D"3509" data-end=3D"3562">
<p data-start=3D"3511" data-end=3D"3562"><strong data-start=3D"3511" data-e=
nd=3D"3559">Stop expecting L2 cache to make joins faster</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3563" data-end=3D"3614">
<p data-start=3D"3565" data-end=3D"3614"><strong data-start=3D"3565" data-e=
nd=3D"3611">Use DTOs, projections, and batch/streaming</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3615" data-end=3D"3651">
<p data-start=3D"3617" data-end=3D"3651"><strong data-start=3D"3617" data-e=
nd=3D"3648">Index well and optimize SQL</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3652" data-end=3D"3717">
<p data-start=3D"3654" data-end=3D"3717"><strong data-start=3D"3654" data-e=
nd=3D"3716">Cache reference or computed data only at application level</str=
ong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"3719" data-end=3D"3866">This approach maximizes throughput=
, minimizes DB round-trips, and avoids the pitfalls of stacking L2 cache an=
d Spring cache on the same entities.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"3868" data-end=3D"3871">
<p data-start=3D"3873" data-end=3D"4101">If you want, I can draft a <strong=
 data-start=3D"3900" data-end=3D"4009">concrete example combining Spring Sp=
ecifications + DTO projections + batch fetching + read-only streaming</stro=
ng> =E2=80=94 basically a ready-to-use =E2=80=9Chigh-performance dynamic qu=
ery template=E2=80=9D for Hibernate 7.2.1.</p>
