<p data-start=3D"3294" data-end=3D"3483">=E2=9C=85 Modern DB: <strong data-=
start=3D"3307" data-end=3D"3365">order of AND predicates in WHERE clause do=
esn=E2=80=99t matter</strong><br data-start=3D"3365" data-end=3D"3368">
=E2=9C=85 Focus on: indexes, joins, projection, and query plan<br data-star=
t=3D"3422" data-end=3D"3425">
=E2=9C=85 Manual predicate ordering is <strong data-start=3D"3456" data-end=
=3D"3481">almost never worth it</strong></p>
