<ul data-start=3D"3504" data-end=3D"3797">
<li data-start=3D"3504" data-end=3D"3600">
<p data-start=3D"3506" data-end=3D"3600">You <strong data-start=3D"3510" da=
ta-end=3D"3563">don=E2=80=99t need to order Specifications by selectivity</=
strong> =E2=80=94 let the DB optimizer do its job.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3601" data-end=3D"3684">
<p data-start=3D"3603" data-end=3D"3684">Optimize by <strong data-start=3D"=
3615" data-end=3D"3681">indexing, filtering joins, and reducing unnecessary=
 predicates</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3685" data-end=3D"3797">
<p data-start=3D"3687" data-end=3D"3797">Predicate ordering only matters in=
 edge cases with <strong data-start=3D"3738" data-end=3D"3764">non-SARGable=
 functions</strong> or extremely naive DB engines.</p>
